These are the 5 most important Linked List patterns that repeatedly appear in interviews.

1. Reverse Linked List
Pattern
Node reverse(Node head){
    Node prev = null;
    Node curr = head;


    while(curr != null){
        Node front = curr.next;
        curr.next = prev;
        prev = curr;
        curr = front;
    }
    return prev;
}
